---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { services } from '../data/services';
---
<Layout title="Protection with purpose">
  <section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal"></span> PEOPLE. PROPERTY. PEACE OF MIND.</p><h1>Protection<br/>with <em>purpose.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">Your people and places deserve a considered approach to security. Let’s start with what matters to you.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/">Request a consultation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#services">Explore our services <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-note"><span>EXCALIBUR SECURITY</span><span>Los Angeles & Southern California</span></div></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="/architecture.svg" alt="Architectural illustration of a modern commercial building at dusk" width="720" height="800" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="art-label"><span class="crosshair">＋</span><div>Every space is different.<br/><strong>Its protection should be, too.</strong></div><span class="art-index">01 / 04</span></div></div></div></section>
  <div class="principles"><div class="container"><span>BUILT AROUND YOUR NEEDS</span><p>People-first planning</p><p>Site-specific thinking</p><p>A clear path forward</p></div></div>
  <section id="services" class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow red">01 / OUR SERVICES</p><h2>The right protection.<br/>For your world.</h2></div><p>From everyday spaces to important occasions, explore a security approach that fits.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{services.map(service => <a class="service-card" href={`/services/${service.slug}/`}><div class="card-top"><span>{service.number}</span><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>{service.title}</h3><p>{service.short}</p><span class="card-bottom">Explore service <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></a>)}</div></section>
  <section id="industries" class="industries"><div class="container industry-grid"><div class="industry-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="plan-lines"></div><span class="plan-caption">A DIFFERENT PERSPECTIVE<br/>ON EVERY PROPERTY.</span><span class="plan-coordinate">34°03′ N &nbsp; 118°15′ W</span></div><div class="industry-copy"><p class="eyebrow red">02 / PLACES WE PROTECT</p><h2>Different settings.<br/>One clear priority.</h2><p>Security starts with understanding the environment: who uses it, how it operates, and what needs attention.</p><ul class="industry-list">{['Commercial properties', 'Residential communities', 'Construction & industrial sites', 'Events & film production'].map((name, i) => <li><span>0{i+1}</span>{name}</li>)}</ul><a class="text-link dark" href="/contact/">Tell us about your site <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
  <section id="approach" class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow red">03 / A CONSIDERED APPROACH</p><h2>Good security starts<br/>with a conversation.</h2></div><p>A proposed consultation journey, designed to make the next step clear.</p></div><div class="steps">{[{title:'Understand your needs',text:'Start with your property, people, and priorities. Tell us what you need to protect.'},{title:'Consider the details',text:'Discuss the setting, schedule, and practical requirements of your security coverage.'},{title:'Shape the right plan',text:'Explore a tailored proposal and agree on the next steps before moving forward.'}].map((step,i)=><article><span class="step-number">0{i+1}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="contact-band"><div class="container"><div><p class="eyebrow">LET’S START WITH WHAT MATTERS</p><h2>Your priorities.<br/>Our starting point.</h2></div><div><p>Tell us a little about the protection you’re looking for.</p><a class="button light" href="/contact/">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><small>Demo form. No information is sent.</small></div></div></section>
</Layout>
